tools/roce/ is a port of the one-shot RoCE all-gather in TensorFold's patch 0230
(https://github.com/ashhart/TensorFold), which adapted b12x's "RoCEnante"
(https://github.com/local-inference-lab/b12x, b12x/comm/roce).

