Changes from TensorFold's version: environment knobs renamed GLM53_TF_* -> DSV41_*; the extension is named
dsv41_roce_v1; the GLM-5.3/comm integration is replaced by tools/bench_roce_gather.py and the engine's
collective path. See tools/bench_roce_gather.py for the two-node NCCL comparison.
